dodobian-theme (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Lighter, tighter window shadows (active 20 px at 20%, 4 px down; inactive
    12 px at 13%, 2 px down), close to the shadows GTK4 and libadwaita windows
    draw themselves, so windows look alike whoever draws the frame.

